<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>PC-88 게임 분석을 위한 기초 강좌 2부 — Z80 어셈블리 코드를 읽는 법</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f5f7fb;--paper:#fff;--ink:#172033;--muted:#5b6578;--line:#d8deea;
  --accent:#3157d5;--accent2:#2342a3;--soft:#eef3ff;--ok:#13795b;--warn:#9a6700;
  --code:#111827;--codeink:#e5e7eb;--shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(23,32,51,.08)
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI","Noto Sans KR","Malgun Gothic",sans-serif;line-height:1.75}
a{color:var(--accent2)}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#172554,#2746b8);color:#fff;padding:54px 20px 46px}
.header-inner{max-width:1080px;margin:auto}.eyebrow{font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:800;opacity:.82}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.13;margin:.35rem 0 .8rem}.lead{max-width:930px;font-size:1.08rem;color:#e3e9ff;margin:0}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 20px 80px}
nav.toc{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px;margin-top:-24px;position:relative}
nav.toc strong{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:1.15rem}nav.toc ol{margin:0;padding-left:1.4rem;columns:2;column-gap:2rem}nav.toc li{break-inside:avoid;margin:.25rem 0}
section{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;margin-top:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(23,32,51,.04)}
h2{font-size:1.75rem;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.3}h3{font-size:1.22rem;margin:1.9rem 0 .65rem}h4{font-size:1.05rem;margin:1.3rem 0 .4rem}p{margin:.55rem 0 1rem}
.kicker{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:.92rem}.term{font-weight:800;color:#183c98}.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.note,.warning,.pc88-note{padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;margin:16px 0}.note{background:#f4f7fb;border:1px solid #dce4ef}.warning{background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #f4d78c}.pc88-note{background:#ecfdf5;border:1px solid #a7f3d0}
.beginner{background:#f8fbff;border:1px solid #c9d8ff;border-left:5px solid #3157d5;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 17px;margin:16px 0}.beginner b:first-child{color:#183c98}
.why{background:#fffdf3;border:1px solid #eadb9a;border-left:5px solid #c58a00;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 17px;margin:16px 0}
.misconception{background:#fff5f5;border:1px solid #f0c7c7;border-left:5px solid #c73b3b;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 17px;margin:16px 0}
code,kbd{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace}.inline-code{background:#eef1f6;border:1px solid #d9dfe9;border-radius:5px;padding:.06rem .32rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}
pre{background:var(--code);color:var(--codeink);padding:16px;border-radius:13px;overflow:auto;line-height:1.58;tab-size:4}
pre .cm{color:#a7f3d0} pre .op{color:#bfdbfe} pre .num{color:#fde68a}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0 20px;font-size:.96rem}th,td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 10px;text-align:center}th{background:#f3f6fb}td.left,th.left{text-align:left}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;background:#fbfcfe}.card h4{margin-top:0}
.flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:18px 0}.flow .box{border:2px solid #9fb0e9;background:#f5f7ff;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 18px;text-align:center;min-width:125px;font-weight:800}.arrow{font-size:1.6rem;color:#6b7ab6;font-weight:900}
.readout{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;background:#f2f5fa;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;margin-top:10px;white-space:pre-wrap}.controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0}.btn{border:1px solid #a8b3c6;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.btn.active{background:#3157d5;color:#fff;border-color:#3157d5}.btn.done{background:#13795b;color:#fff;border-color:#13795b}.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.btn.active:disabled,.btn.done:disabled{opacity:1}
.step-list{counter-reset:steps;display:grid;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}.step{counter-increment:steps;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfcfe;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 15px 13px 52px;position:relative}.step:before{content:counter(steps);position:absolute;left:14px;top:13px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#3157d5;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:.85rem}.step b{color:#243d91}
.keypoint{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:14px 0}.keypoint>div{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;background:#fff}.keypoint b{display:block;color:#2444a8;margin-bottom:3px}
.formula{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:900;background:#eef3ff;border:1px solid #cad6f8;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;text-align:center;margin:12px 0}
.glossary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:14px 0}.glossary>div{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.glossary>div:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}.glossary .gterm{font-weight:900;background:#f3f6fb;color:#2444a8}.glossary .gdesc{background:#fff}
.state-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;background:#f8faff}.changed{background:#ecfdf5!important;font-weight:800;color:#0f6a4f}.unchanged{color:#64748b}
.code-anatomy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:14px 0}.code-anatomy>div{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.code-anatomy>div:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}.code-anatomy .label{font-weight:900;background:#f3f6fb;color:#2444a8}.code-anatomy .desc{background:#fff}
.memory{display:grid;grid-template-columns:105px 1fr;max-width:600px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:14px 0}.memory div{padding:8px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.memory div:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}.addr{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;background:#f3f6fb;font-weight:800}.val{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}.sel{background:#fff3bf!important;outline:2px solid #e6b800;outline-offset:-2px}
.flag-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:5px;margin:12px 0}.flag-bit{border:1px solid #aebbd8;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 4px;text-align:center;background:#f8faff;min-height:78px}.flag-bit b{display:block;color:#2444a8;font-size:1.05rem}.flag-bit small{display:block;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.25}.flag-bit.on{background:#eaf0ff;border-color:#3157d5}.flag-bit.fixed{background:#fff8e6}
.trace{overflow:auto}.trace table{min-width:720px}.trace td code{font-size:.92rem}
.compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 70px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0}.compare .side{border:2px solid #a9b7df;border-radius:13px;padding:15px;background:#f7f9ff}.compare .middle{text-align:center;font-size:1.7rem;color:#6b7ab6;font-weight:900}
.stackmem{max-width:620px;margin:15px auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.stackrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 160px}.stackrow>div{padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.stackrow:last-child>div{border-bottom:0}.stackrow .a{background:#f3f6fb;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:800}.stackrow .v{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}.stackrow.hot{background:#fff8e6}
.byte-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:14px 0}.byte{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 13px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:800}.byte.opcode{background:#2342a3}.byte.operand{background:#6b7280}.byte.prefix{background:#7c3aed}
.quiz details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 13px;margin:9px 0;background:#fbfcfe}.quiz summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:800}.answer{margin-top:8px;color:#334155}
footer{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto 60px;padding:0 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}

.lab{border:1px solid #cbd7f2;background:#f8faff;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0}.lab h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#2444a8}.lab label{font-weight:800;margin-right:6px}.lab input,.lab select{font:inherit;border:1px solid #a8b3c6;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:7px 9px;min-width:90px}.lab .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:9px 0}.regboard{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin:10px 0}.regbox{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:9px 10px;text-align:center}.regbox b{display:block;color:#2444a8}.bits{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;background:#111827;color:#e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;display:inline-block}.path-taken{background:#ecfdf5;border-color:#86d7bd}.path-skip{background:#fff8e6;border-color:#e7c56f}.io-board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:10px 0}.io-box{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:12px}.io-box b{display:block;color:#2444a8;margin-bottom:4px}.trace-line{border-left:4px solid #3157d5;background:#eef3ff;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}.trace-line.done{border-left-color:#13795b;background:#ecfdf5}.trace-line.pending{opacity:.62}
@media(max-width:760px){nav.toc ol{columns:1}.grid2,.grid3,.compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid2>*,.grid3>*,.compare>*,.card,.io-box,.regbox{min-width:0}.keypoint{grid-template-columns:1fr}.compare .middle{transform:rotate(90deg)}section{padding:23px 18px}.glossary,.code-anatomy{grid-template-columns:110px 1fr}.flag-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.stackrow{grid-template-columns:90px 1fr}.stackrow .desc{display:none}.regboard{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.io-board{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1,h2,h3,h4,.btn{word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word}}
@media print{body{background:#fff}header{background:#fff;color:#000;padding:20px 0}.lead{color:#333}.wrap{padding:0}.toc,section{box-shadow:none;break-inside:avoid}button{display:none}.no-print{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="header-inner">
<div class="eyebrow">PC-88 GAME ANALYSIS · FOUNDATION 02</div>
<h1>PC-88 게임 분석을 위한 기초 강좌 2부</h1>
<p class="lead">Z80 어셈블리 코드를 처음 보는 사람을 기준으로, 한 줄의 문법부터 값·주소·포인터, flag와 분기, stack과 subroutine, block transfer, I/O까지 실제 실행 상태를 따라가며 배웁니다. 목표는 명령어를 외우는 것이 아니라 주석 없는 실제 disassembly를 읽고 코드 블록의 역할을 판단하는 것입니다.</p>
</div>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
<nav class="toc" aria-label="목차">
<strong>목차</strong>
<ol>
<li><a href="#map">먼저 전체 학습 흐름 보기</a></li>
<li><a href="#syntax">1. Z80 코드를 읽기 위한 표기법</a></li>
<li><a href="#address">2. 값·주소·메모리와 PC</a></li>
<li><a href="#load">3. LD와 pointer</a></li>
<li><a href="#math">4. 산술·논리와 bit 처리</a></li>
<li><a href="#branch">5. Flag·CP·분기·반복</a></li>
<li><a href="#stack">6. CALL·RET·stack·index register</a></li>
<li><a href="#block">7. Block transfer·검색·bit·shift</a></li>
<li><a href="#io">8. I/O·interrupt·prefix opcode</a></li>
<li><a href="#reverse">9. 실제 disassembly를 읽는 방법</a></li>
<li><a href="#practice">10. 종합 실습</a></li>
<li><a href="#quiz">확인 문제</a></li>
</ol>
</nav>

<section id="map">
<div class="kicker">전체 구조</div>
<h2>2부에서는 무엇을 할 수 있게 되는가</h2>
<p>0부에서는 register, RAM, address, machine language, stack 같은 컴퓨터의 기본 개념을 배웠고, 1부에서는 그 개념이 PC-88의 Main RAM, ROM, GVRAM, Expanded RAM, I/O와 어떻게 연결되는지 살펴봤습니다. 이제 2부에서는 그 지식을 <b>실제 Z80 코드</b>에 적용합니다.</p>
<div class="flow">
<div class="box">한 줄의 문법</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
